:113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-18835d2af1db80476b35","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-12ec9479cee2fb4b3c56","layer":"pei","quote":"尚书傅巽谓夔曰：‘仪不相好已甚。子友毛玠，玠等，仪已害之矣。子宜少下之","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cdde0917d9029a309b9c","start":25,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-1ca58c8c7c2a520497a4","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b98fdf30cfe006001885","layer":"original","quote":"魏国既建，为尚书，复典选举","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-25e4909814f4654dea66","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-0a3a86ab355fa52524e1","layer":"original","quote":"将避乱荆州，未至；闻刘表政令不明，遂住鲁阳","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-296494891834bbc8f97c","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-746db3a75b126cca4704","layer":"original","quote":"后群僚会，玠起更衣〖17〗。太祖目指曰：“此古所谓国之司直〖18〗，我之周昌也","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-3c287c22c47dbe15e786","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-1fad2e8748149fe35370","layer":"original","quote":"初，太祖平柳城，班所获器物〖14〗；特以素屏风、素凭几赐玠，曰：“君有古人之风，故赐君古人之服","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-42af6ea86d9332af280b","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-d792dbb74ac363a9e023","layer":"original","quote":"其所举用，皆清正之士；虽于时有盛名，而行不由本者，终莫得进。务以俭率人〖8〗，由是天下之士，莫不以廉节自励；虽贵宠之臣，舆服不敢过度","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":184,"end":250,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-4616e022509cf3edd334","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-cc7f8da1c3b5a79d1c6c","layer":"original","quote":"玠曰：“臣闻萧生缢死〖23〗，困于石显〖24〗；贾子放外〖25〗，谗在绛、灌〖26〗；白起赐剑于杜邮〖27〗；晁错致诛于东市〖28〗；伍员绝命于吴都〖29〗：斯数子者，或妒其前，或害其后。臣垂髫执简〖30〗，累勤取官〖31〗；职在机近，人事所窜〖32〗。属臣以私，无势不绝〖33〗；语臣以冤，无细不理。人情淫利〖34〗，为法所禁；法禁于利，势能害之。青蝇横生〖35〗，为臣作谤；谤臣之人，势不在他。昔王叔陈生争（正）〔政〕王廷〖36〗，宣子平理〖37〗，命举其契〖38〗；是非有宜，曲直有所：《春秋》嘉焉，是以书之。臣不言此〖39〗，无有时、人。说臣此言，必有征要〖40〗。乞蒙宣子之辨〖41〗，而求王叔之对。若臣以曲闻〖42〗，即刑之日，方之安驷之赠〖43〗；赐剑之来〖44〗，比之重赏之惠。谨以状对","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":136,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":351,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-5d4a4cfe1d0dc9e816a8","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-1fad2e8748149fe35370","layer":"original","quote":"魏国初建，为尚书仆射，复典选举","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":94,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-5e157fe0524f13620f11","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-746db3a75b126cca4704","layer":"original","quote":"玠密谏曰：“近者袁绍以嫡庶不分，覆宗灭国。废立大事，非所宜闻","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-7dc6d5cdc1266bb24215","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-c9e4420932e761e89bb9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖知其情，令曰：“日出于东，月盛于东；凡人言方〖13〗，亦复先东：何以省东曹？”遂省西曹","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":55,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-8e3ad175302fb9000a3a","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-fe0442a5805bdf328d16","layer":"original","quote":"大理钟繇诘玠曰：“自古圣帝明王，罪及妻子。《书》云：‘左不共左〖2〗，右不共右〖3〗，予则孥戮汝〖4〗！’司寇之职〖5〗，‘男子入于罪隶〖6〗，女子入于舂稿〖7〗’。汉律：罪人妻子没为奴婢，黥面。汉法所行黥墨之刑，存于古典。今真奴婢祖先有罪〖8〗，虽历百世，犹有黥面供官〖9〗；一以宽良民之命，二以宥并罪之辜〖10〗。此何以负于神明之意，而当致旱？案典谋〖11〗：‘急恒寒若〖12〗，舒恒燠若〖13〗。’宽则亢阳，所以为旱。玠之吐言，以为宽邪？以为急也？急当阴霖，何以反旱？成汤圣世〖14〗，野无生草〖15〗；周宣令主〖16〗，旱魃为虐〖17〗。亢旱以来，积三十年；归咎黥面，为相值不〖18〗？卫人伐邢〖19〗，师兴而雨；罪恶无征，何以应天？玠讥谤之言，流于下民；不悦之声，上闻圣听。玠之吐言，势不独语；时见黥面，凡为几人？黥面奴婢，所识知邪〖20〗？何缘得见，对之叹言？时以语谁？见答云何〖21〗？以何日月〖22〗？于何处所？事已发露，不得隐欺，具以状对","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":428,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-9370475624ee4c28c893","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a2a5937f000469042d73","layer":"original","quote":"卒于家","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-9eb2268fb6af2ccd0621","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-d792dbb74ac363a9e023","layer":"original","quote":"太祖临兖州〖3〗，辟为治中从事","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-a49cb30080e12b997156","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-da535e875fd74c51f531","layer":"original","quote":"后有白玠者：“出见黥面反者〖1〗，其妻子没为官奴婢，玠言曰：‘使天不雨者，盖此也","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-a4da731576cf411a137d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-d792dbb74ac363a9e023","layer":"original","quote":"玠语太祖曰：“今天下分崩，国主迁移；生民废业，饥馑流亡；公家无经岁之储〖4〗，百姓无安固之志：难以持久。今袁绍、刘表，虽士民众强，皆无经远之虑，未有树基建本者也。夫兵义者胜〖5〗，守位以财；宜奉天子以令不臣，修耕植，蓄军资；如此，则霸王之业可成也","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":139,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-a9104d6ad32d7e7c2dc6","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a2a5937f000469042d73","layer":"original","quote":"时桓阶、和洽进言救玠〖45〗，玠遂免黜","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b28ae40972eefa17638a","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-d792dbb74ac363a9e023","layer":"original","quote":"太祖敬纳其言，转幕府功曹","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":141,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b2a734b1eb1d9b8f59b5","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-744efc38dc3e2f2fb8f8","layer":"original","quote":"魏国初建，拜尚书","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-dd6de9b60271c9cf930b","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a2a5937f000469042d73","layer":"original","quote":"太祖赐棺器、钱帛，拜子机郎中","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":31,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e1b4ef7696e8c5bb3c3e","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-12ec9479cee2fb4b3c56","layer":"pei","quote":"夔曰：‘为不义，适足害其身，焉能害人？且怀奸佞之心，立于明朝，其得久乎","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cdde0917d9029a309b9c","start":62,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e3562103fa6a3b29d2d2","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-d792dbb74ac363a9e023","layer":"original","quote":"太祖叹曰：“用人如此，使天下人自治，吾复何为哉","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":251,"end":274,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f64dd75690c1e8af256d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-2e6b5a5ab343e29e7c9d","layer":"original","quote":"亲自诣玠，属所亲眷〖10〗。玠答曰：“老臣以能守职，幸得免戾；今所说人，非迁次〖11〗，是以不敢奉命","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f703cf1be8fb21d78fe6","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-da535e875fd74c51f531","layer":"original","quote":"太祖大怒，收玠付狱","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":53,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f74d262208dac1493645","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-c9e4420932e761e89bb9","layer":"original","quote":"大军还邺，议所并省。玠请谒不行〖12〗；时人惮之，咸欲省东曹。用共白曰：“旧，西曹为上，东曹为次；宜省东曹","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-0df6e379d9342b276a19","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-1fad2e8748149fe35370","layer":"original","quote":"初，太祖平柳城，班所获器物〖14〗；特以素屏风、素凭几赐玠，曰：“君有古人之风，故赐君古人之服〖15〗。”玠居显位，常布衣蔬食，抚育孤兄子甚笃；赏赐以赈施贫族，家无所余。迁右军师〖16〗。魏国初建，为尚书仆射，复典选举。﹝一﹞","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-4b8bee0f6b1e682aab3e","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-fe0442a5805bdf328d16","layer":"original","quote":"大理钟繇诘玠曰：“自古圣帝明王，罪及妻子。《书》云：‘左不共左〖2〗，右不共右〖3〗，予则孥戮汝〖4〗！’司寇之职〖5〗，‘男子入于罪隶〖6〗，女子入于舂稿〖7〗’。汉律：罪人妻子没为奴婢，黥面。汉法所行黥墨之刑，存于古典。今真奴婢祖先有罪〖8〗，虽历百世，犹有黥面供官〖9〗；一以宽良民之命，二以宥并罪之辜〖10〗。此何以负于神明之意，而当致旱？案典谋〖11〗：‘急恒寒若〖12〗，舒恒燠若〖13〗。’宽则亢阳，所以为旱。玠之吐言，以为宽邪？以为急也？急当阴霖，何以反旱？成汤圣世〖14〗，野无生草〖15〗；周宣令主〖16〗，旱魃为虐〖17〗。亢旱以来，积三十年；归咎黥面，为相值不〖18〗？卫人伐邢〖19〗，师兴而雨；罪恶无征，何以应天？玠讥谤之言，流于下民；不悦之声，上闻圣听。玠之吐言，势不独语；时见黥面，凡为几人？黥面奴婢，所识知邪〖20〗？何缘得见，对之叹言？时以语谁？见答云何〖21〗？以何日月〖22〗？于何处所？事已发露，不得隐欺，具以状对！”","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":430,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-a8c00191aeb4e437d1ca","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-2657b9c15a610ffae7a3","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《先贤行状》曰：“玠，雅亮公正，在官清恪。其典选举：拔贞实，斥华伪，进逊行，抑阿党；诸宰官治民功绩不著，而私财丰足者，皆免黜停废，久不选用。于时四海翕然，莫不励行。至乃长吏还者，垢面羸衣，常乘柴车；军吏入府，朝服徒行。人拟壶飧之洁，家象濯缨之操；贵者无秽欲之累，贱者绝奸货之求；吏洁于上，俗移平下：民到于今称之。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a53f473e7623a3b6c186","start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-ccfb21b056e477d88438","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-cc7f8da1c3b5a79d1c6c","layer":"original","quote":"玠曰：“臣闻萧生缢死〖23〗，困于石显〖24〗；贾子放外〖25〗，谗在绛、灌〖26〗；白起赐剑于杜邮〖27〗；晁错致诛于东市〖28〗；伍员绝命于吴都〖29〗：斯数子者，或妒其前，或害其后。臣垂髫执简〖30〗，累勤取官〖31〗；职在机近，人事所窜〖32〗。属臣以私，无势不绝〖33〗；语臣以冤，无细不理。人情淫利〖34〗，为法所禁；法禁于利，势能害之。青蝇横生〖35〗，为臣作谤；谤臣之人，势不在他。昔王叔陈生争（正）〔政〕王廷〖36〗，宣子平理〖37〗，命举其契〖38〗；是非有宜，曲直有所：《春秋》嘉焉，是以书之。臣不言此〖39〗，无有时、人。说臣此言，必有征要〖40〗。乞蒙宣子之辨〖41〗，而求王叔之对。若臣以曲闻〖42〗，即刑之日，方之安驷之赠〖43〗；赐剑之来〖44〗，比之重赏之惠。谨以状对。”","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":136,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":353,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-47a228c44b2ba9746217","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-4eae1aa6eaf8dd106a16","layer":"original","quote":"太祖曰：“所以不考，欲两全玠及言事者耳。”洽对曰：“玠信有谤主之言〖27〗，当肆之市朝〖28〗；若玠无此，言事者加诬大臣以误主听。二者不加检核，臣窃不安。”太祖曰：“方有军事，安可受人言便考之邪〖29〗？狐射姑刺阳处父于朝〖30〗，此为君之诫也〖31〗。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-a6153efd00a429c80c1b","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-09ea6e777225a545c40c","layer":"original","quote":"洽对曰：“如言事者言，玠罪过深重，非天地所覆载；臣非敢曲理玠以枉大伦也〖19〗。以玠出群吏之中，特见拔擢，显在首职〖20〗；历年荷宠〖21〗，刚直忠公，为众所惮：不宜有此。然人情难保，要宜考核〖22〗，两验其实〖23〗。今圣恩垂含垢之仁〖24〗，不忍致之于理〖25〗；更使曲直之分不明，疑自近始〖26〗。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-e718a6e06d9ecd9aab9e","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-348784738957769cd51f","layer":"original","quote":"魏国既建，为侍中。后有白毛玠谤毁太祖；太祖见近臣，怒甚。洽陈玠素行有本，求案实其事〖13〗。罢朝，太祖令曰；“今言事者白玠不但谤吾也，乃复为崔琰觖望〖14〗。此损君臣恩义，妄为死友怨叹〖15〗，殆不可忍也。昔萧、曹与高祖并起微贱〖16〗，致功立勋。高祖每在屈笮〖17〗，二相恭顺，臣道益彰，所以祚及后世也。和侍中比求实之，所以不听，欲重参之耳〖18〗。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-01fca3bdbcbaaa53a0c6","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-fde3ea16fb0f48bf4083","layer":"original","quote":"又毛玠、徐奕以刚謇少党〖7〗，而为西曹掾丁仪所不善〖8〗；仪屡言其短，赖阶左右以自全保〖9〗。其将顺匡救，多此类也","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-p008","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-5476707ed7cc1389d719","layer":"pei","quote":"丁亥令曰：“故尚书仆射毛玠，奉常王修、凉茂，郎中令袁涣，少府谢奂、万潜，中尉徐奕、国渊等，皆忠直在朝，履蹈仁义；并早即世，而子孙陵迟，恻然愍之。其皆拜子男为郎中。”","attribution":"裴注·魏书续引","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2a980d42bd6d8f9a3005","start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p112a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9536581b8deb5e7104e4","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》载：“公令曰：‘夫受九锡，广开土宇，周公其人也。汉之异姓八王者，与高祖俱起布衣，创定王业，其功至大。吾何可比之？’前后三让。于是中军师、陵树亭侯荀攸，前军师、东武亭侯钟繇，左军师凉茂，右军师毛玠，平虏将军、华乡侯刘勋，建武将军、清苑亭侯刘若，伏波将军、高安侯夏侯惇，扬武将军、都亭侯王忠，奋威将军、乐乡侯（刘）〔邓〕展，建忠将军、昌乡亭侯鲜于辅，奋武将军、安国亭侯程昱，太中大夫、都乡侯贾诩，军师祭酒、千秋亭侯董昭，都亭侯薛洪，南乡亭侯董蒙，关内侯王粲、傅巽，祭酒王选、袁涣、王朗、张承、任藩、杜袭，中护军、国明亭侯曹洪，中领军、万岁亭侯韩浩，行骁骑将军、安平亭侯曹仁，领护军将军王图，长史万潜、谢奂、袁霸等，劝进曰：‘自古三代，胙臣以土；受命中兴，封秩辅佐。皆所以褒功赏德，为国藩卫也。往者天下崩乱，群凶豪起；颠越跋扈之险，不可忍言。明公奋身出命以徇其难，诛二袁篡盗之逆，灭黄巾贼乱之类，殄夷首逆，芟拨荒秽，沐浴霜露二十余年。书契以来，未有若此功者。昔周公承文、武之迹，受已成之业，高枕墨笔，拱揖群后，商、奄之勤，不过二年；吕望因三分有二之形，据八百诸侯之势，暂把旄钺，一时指麾：然皆大启土宇，跨州兼国。周公八子，并为侯伯：白牡骍刚，郊祀天地；典策备物，拟则王室。荣章宠盛如此之弘也。逮至汉兴，佐命之臣张耳、吴芮，其功至薄，亦连城开地，南面称孤。此皆明君达主行之于上，贤臣圣宰受之于下；三代令典，汉帝明制。今比劳则周、吕逸，计功则张、吴微，论制则齐、鲁重，言地则长沙多；然则魏国之封，九锡之荣，况于旧赏，犹怀玉而被褐也。且列侯、诸将，幸攀龙骥，得窃微劳，佩紫怀黄，盖以百数，亦将因此传之万世。而明公独辞赏于上，将使其下怀不自安。上违圣朝欢心，下失冠带至望；忘辅弼之大业，信匹夫之细行。攸等所大惧也！’于是公敕外为章，但受魏郡。攸等复曰：‘伏见魏国初封，圣朝发虑，稽谋群僚，然后策命；而明公久违上指，不即大礼。今既虔奉诏命，副顺众望；又欲辞多当少，让九受一。是犹汉朝之赏不行，而攸等之请未许也。昔齐、鲁之封，奄有东海；疆域井赋，四百万家；基隆业广，易以立功；故能成翼戴之勋，立一匡之绩。今魏国虽有十郡之名，犹减于曲阜；计其户数，不能参半：以藩卫王室，立垣树屏，犹未足也。且圣上览亡秦无辅之祸，惩曩日震荡之艰；托建忠贤，废坠是为。愿明公恭承帝命，无或拒违。’公乃受命。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":262,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-97e94061646080072adf","start":0,"end":988,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p115a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31f474fc7e57ab9555e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“以荀攸为尚书令；凉茂为仆射；毛玠、崔琰、常林、徐奕、何夔为尚书；王粲、杜袭、卫觊、和洽为侍中。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-efecfa99851d5aa2b4e2","start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{